      f"{fc['spinor_times_vector_triplet']['klein_group_cover_8']['norm_squared_of_the_character']}).\n")
    w("**Does a threefold label survive?**\n")
    fm = fc["frame_matching_between_the_triplet_copies"]
    w("| Symmetry of the law on the register concerned | Threefold label | Protected | Consequence |\n"
